@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Client / User" as Client
box "FastAPI Layer" #AliceBlue
    participant "Router / Endpoint\n(get_task)" as Endpoint
    participant "Auth / Dependencies\n(get_current_user, get_db)" as Deps
end box

box "Repository Layer" #GhostWhite
    participant "TaskRepository" as TaskRepo
end box

database "Database\n(AsyncSession)" as DB

== Khởi tạo & Tiêm phụ thuộc ==
Client -> Endpoint: GET /tasks/{task_id}\n(Bearer Token)
activate Endpoint

Endpoint -> Deps: Xác thực user & tạo AsyncSession
activate Deps
Deps --> Endpoint: current_user, session
deactivate Deps

== 1. Tìm thông tin Task ==
Endpoint -> TaskRepo: get_by_id(task_id)
activate TaskRepo
TaskRepo -> DB: SELECT task WHERE id = task_id
DB --> TaskRepo: task data / null
TaskRepo --> Endpoint: task
deactivate TaskRepo

== 2. Kiểm tra kết quả & Phản hồi ==
alt #MistyRose Task không tồn tại
    Endpoint --> Client: 404 Not Found ("Không tìm thấy task")
else #Honeydew Task tồn tại
    Endpoint --> Client: 200 OK (TaskResponse)
end

deactivate Endpoint
@enduml